; error: 7:5: 'bind' is a reserved word with no use yet; a variable that never changes is written 'fixed'
; Names that take a tuple apart may be written against the word, 'fixed(a, b) = t',
; so the message names the word to write there too.

task main()
    fixed t = (1, 2)
    bind(a, b) = t
    show(a + b)
fi
